Helper scripts
==============

1. etc/tools/buildInRAM.sh -h
Used for building the project in RAM disc. This is still experimental only.

2. etc/tools/config.pl
Pretty prints input config file (CSV format) to standard output. It converts the original format to
standardized format to simplify diffing with repository versions of e.g. logon-persistence/etc/csv/refdata/config.csv

3. etc/tools/exportInitialData.sh
Creates a zip file containing the current initial data files located under logon-persistence/etc/sql.
Used for attaching the zip into the translation ticket (e.g. LOGON-7949), so that crh can manually add the translations into the insert / upsert statements, and send the updated zip back.
(The import script is located at: logon-persistence/etc/import_crh_files.sh)

4. etc/tools/generateNewLitDictKey.sh -h
Used when adding a new entry to LitDict.global
